  "content_html": "<h1>i felt my self sinking</h1>\n<p class=\"momentDate\">c. 2015</p>\n<div data-docs-catalogue-ref=\"c1\"><figure class=\"docsViewerFigure docsViewerFigure--full-column\" data-docs-content-detail=\"media\" data-docs-media-kind=\"catalogue-work\" data-docs-media-id=\"04654\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"docsViewer__mediaImageLink docsViewerFigure__imageLink\" data-docs-media-open aria-label=\"Open I felt my self sinking\"><img data-docs-media-image src=\"https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/04654-primary-800.webp?v=1\" srcset=\"https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/04654-primary-800.webp?v=1 800w, https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/04654-primary-1200.webp?v=1 1200w, https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/04654-primary-1600.webp?v=1 1600w\" sizes=\"100vw\" alt=\"I felt my self sinking\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2133\" decoding=\"async\"><span data-docs-media-placeholder hidden>I felt my self sinking</span></button></figure></div>\n<pre class=\"moment-text\">\nI felt my self sinking\nbut I’m on solid ground, as far as I can tell\n \nso it must be the world that’s sinking\n(is there a difference?)\n \nnot alone, because the tree will be there for me (and I for her)\nshould i return\n(it’s not that far away)\n \nwhat matters is that I sink with the world\nthe ground and the sky\n \nand in peace we sink together\n</pre>\n",
